# Design system — shadcn/ui

Read `.arlox/design-system.json` — this project uses **shadcn/ui** on Tailwind with CSS variables.

## Rules

- Use components from `src/components/ui/` — add new ones via `npx shadcn@latest add <component>`.
- Use semantic tokens: `bg-background`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border` — not raw colors like `bg-blue-500`.
- Use `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` for conditional classes.
- Compose with Card, Button, Input, Label before writing custom markup.

## Adding components

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add table dialog select
```

Do not mix Ant Design, MUI, or other libraries in the same project.
